  "about_item": [
    "【SIZE M FOR MEDIUM BREEDS】 Designed to fit snout circumferences for medium dogs like Beagles, Corgis, and Border Collies. Sizing does not correspond to weight. Please measure your dog's snout before purchasing to ensure a proper fit. Not suitable for short-snouted dogs.",
    "【ALLOWS PANTING & DRINKING】 The humane design features a proper opening space that allows your pet to breathe naturally, pant, and drink water without restriction, reducing anxiety during daily walks or vet visits.",
    "【PREVENT SCAVENGING & BITING】 Acts as an effective mouth guard to stop your dog from chewing unwanted items, eating garbage, or biting. Ideal for training, safe socialization, and grooming sessions.",
    "【BREATHABLE 3D AIR MESH】 Made with durable nylon and soft 3D air mesh fabric. This lightweight construction provides optimal airflow, preventing overheating and ensuring your pet stays comfortable even during extended use.",
    "【SECURE & ESCAPE-PROOF】 Features an adjustable neck and snout strap to keep the dog muzzle securely in place. The snug fit prevents dogs from easily pawing it off, giving you better control and peace of mind outdoors."
  ],
