        "position": 1,
        "title": "Soft Mesh Muzzle Works For Calm Control",
        "text": "I picked up this soft muzzle for simple walks around the neighborhood, and it turned out to be a helpful tool. The mesh feels gentle, and it sits lightly without bothering the dog. It stays in place well and doesn’t look bulky. For everyday moments when I need a bit more control, it does the job smoothly.",
